==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.33~6.67 seconds<sup>10f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.33~2 seconds<sup>10f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
