**1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is quite simple. If you have [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]], then spawn him at the start to kill the peons and build cash. Hold off the Cyberhorns using crowd-controllers like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and DPS dealers like [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]]. Meatshield well and use [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]] such as [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs Cat]] to slowly chip at Camelle and Mr. Mole until they die. Once they do, you've won.

==Trivia==
*Exaggeration Falls' Japanese name, Kagon no Taki (過言の滝, "Exaggeration Falls"), is a pun on 華厳滝 ''Kegon no Taki'', which is Japanese for the [[wikipedia:Kegon Falls|Kegon Falls]], a famous waterfall in [[wikipedia:Nikkō National Park|Nikkō National Park]], Tochigi Prefecture, Japan.

